{"thought": "Felix's 'Thursday at 3' matches the 3:00pm Dec 10 slot I offered on Nov 30, but that is after Bob's hard noon cutoff, so I won't book or record it. The morning proposal is already carded, so I'll explain the conflict and ask Bob whether to waive the cutoff for this meeting.", "tool": "tell_bob", "args": {"text": "Felix Oyelaran replied on the thread: "Thursday at 3 works for me." That matches the Thursday, Dec 10, 3:00 to 3:45pm time I offered him on Nov 30, but it falls after your noon cutoff. Your rule for this one is nothing after 12:00, a hard line from your "Mornings only for this one please," so I have not booked it or recorded it as his yes.

The card as drafted goes to Felix Oyelaran, with you in cc. It offers three 45-minute morning Meet calls: Mon, Dec 7 at 9:45am, Wed, Dec 9 at 9:30am, and Thu, Dec 10 at 9:45am, and notes that these are open morning times. Approve sends it; nothing goes to him until you do.

Do you want to take his Thursday 3pm instead, which would mean dropping the noon cutoff for this meeting? If not, I'll wait for him to pick one of the morning times."}}
